flowchart TB

    %% =========================================================
    %% EXISTING SALIENCE ENTRY PATH — PRESERVE
    %% =========================================================

    Operator["Operators / API Clients / CLI / SDK"]
        -->|scoped business request| API["Control API"]

    API -->|identity / scope / policy / budget| PG[("PostgreSQL")]

    API -->|prevalidated idempotent start + schedules| Temporal["Temporal Adapter"]

    Temporal -->|tasks / timers / retries| Worker["Salience Worker"]

    Worker -->|checkpointed activities| Loop["Intelligence Loop"]


    %% =========================================================
    %% EXTERNAL INTELLIGENCE — EVOLVE
    %% =========================================================

    subgraph External["External Intelligence"]

        Sources["RSS / HN / Approved Sources"]
        Browser["Governed Browser Evidence"]
        PlatformSignals["Platform / Trend Signals"]
        FutureSources["Future Approved Evidence Sources"]

    end

    Sources --> Evidence["Evidence Intake & Quality"]
    Browser --> Evidence
    PlatformSignals --> Evidence
    FutureSources --> Evidence

    Evidence -->|normalized untrusted evidence| Loop

    Browser -.->|text / screenshot / trace receipts| Storage[("Object-Store Contract")]


    %% =========================================================
    %% INTERNAL INTELLIGENCE — NEW
    %% =========================================================

    subgraph Internal["Salience Internal Intelligence"]

        Retrieval["Knowledge & Retrieval Service"]

        ContentHistory["Content / Asset History"]
        DecisionHistory["Decision History"]
        PublicationHistory["Publication History"]
        AudienceHistory["Audience / Performance History"]
        ExperimentHistory["Experiment History"]
        StrategyHistory["Strategy / Learning History"]

    end

    PG --> Retrieval
    Storage --> Retrieval

    ContentHistory --> Retrieval
    DecisionHistory --> Retrieval
    PublicationHistory --> Retrieval
    AudienceHistory --> Retrieval
    ExperimentHistory --> Retrieval
    StrategyHistory --> Retrieval

    Retrieval -->|relevant historical context| Loop


    %% =========================================================
    %% RESEARCH + STRATEGY CAPABILITIES
    %% =========================================================

    Loop -->|direct / delegated capability contract| Agents["Research & Strategy Capabilities"]

    Agents --> CapabilityGateway["Capability Gateway
        Versioned Capability Contract
        Routing
        Cost
        Quality
        Provider Identity
        Fallback / Abstention"]

    CapabilityGateway --> Providers["Model / MCP / A2A / Plugin / Future Adapters"]

    Providers --> CapabilityGateway
    CapabilityGateway --> Agents


    %% =========================================================
    %% DECISION LAYER — NEW / IMPORTANT
    %% =========================================================

    Agents --> Candidates["Candidate Opportunities / Briefs"]

    Candidates --> Allocation["Exploration / Exploitation Allocation"]

    Allocation --> Selection["Decision & Selection Engine
        Compare
        Rank
        Cost / Risk
        Evidence
        Record Why"]

    Selection --> DecisionRecord["DecisionRecord@v1"]

    DecisionRecord --> PG

    Selection -->|selected output| Brief["ContentBrief@v1"]

    Brief --> Creative["Creative Workflow"]


    %% =========================================================
    %% CREATIVE CAPABILITY LAYER — EVOLVE EXISTING PROVIDER
    %% =========================================================

    Creative --> CreativeRouter["Creative Capability Router"]

    CreativeRouter --> CreativeProviders["Approved Provider Adapters
        Text
        Image
        Video
        Audio
        Editing
        Future Multimodal AI"]

    CreativeProviders -->|idempotent submit / reconcile / webhook| Asset["Verified Asset"]

    Asset -.->|hash-stable bytes| Storage


    %% =========================================================
    %% GOVERNANCE / DISTRIBUTION — PRESERVE, CLARIFY
    %% =========================================================

    Creative --> BuildGate["Governance Gate
        Rights
        Policy
        Approval
        Brand
        Budget Reservation"]

    Asset --> BuildGate

    BuildGate --> Distribution["Distribution Package"]

    Distribution --> Ready["ReadyToPublishPackage@v1"]


    %% =========================================================
    %% PUBLICATION — PRESERVE
    %% =========================================================

    Ready -->|new account-bound governed request| Publish["Publication Workflow"]

    Publish --> PublishGate["Final Governance Gate
        Policy
        Rights
        Approval
        Scope
        Current Budget / Reserve"]

    Publish -.->|canonical schedule per Temporal execution| Temporal

    PublishGate --> Publisher["Fixture / Opt-In Publisher Adapter"]

    Storage -.->|short-lived governed HTTPS delivery| Publisher

    Publisher --> ExternalPlatform["Publishing Platform"]

    Publish -->|immutable request / plan / attempt| PG


    %% =========================================================
    %% VERIFIED PUBLICATION — NEW EXPLICIT CONTRACT
    %% =========================================================

    ExternalPlatform --> Receipt["PublicationReceipt@v1"]

    Receipt --> PG


    %% =========================================================
    %% OBSERVATION — MAJOR NEW PLANE
    %% =========================================================

    ExternalPlatform --> Observation["Observation Workflow"]

    Receipt --> Observation

    Observation --> RawObs["ObservationRecord@v1
        Timestamp
        Publication Age
        Platform
        Audience Context
        Impressions
        Views
        Engagement
        Retention
        Conversion
        Revenue
        Data Quality"]

    RawObs --> PG


    %% =========================================================
    %% MEASUREMENT + ATTRIBUTION
    %% =========================================================

    RawObs --> Outcome["Outcome Engine
        Deterministic Metrics
        Normalization
        Time Windows
        Cost / Value"]

    Outcome --> OutcomeRecord["OutcomeRecord@v1"]

    OutcomeRecord --> Attribution["Attribution Engine
        Outcome ↔ Publication
        Outcome ↔ Content
        Outcome ↔ Decision
        Outcome ↔ Strategy
        Outcome ↔ Experiment"]

    Attribution --> AttributionRecord["AttributionRecord@v1"]

    AttributionRecord --> PG


    %% =========================================================
    %% LEARNING — SYSTEM INTELLIGENCE
    %% =========================================================

    AttributionRecord --> Learning["Learning & Evidence Engine"]

    Learning --> Pattern["LearningEvidence@v1
        Evidence-Backed Pattern"]

    Learning --> Hypothesis["Hypothesis@v1"]

    Learning --> FailureKnowledge["Failure / Correction Knowledge"]

    Pattern --> PG
    Hypothesis --> PG
    FailureKnowledge --> PG


    %% =========================================================
    %% STRATEGY EVOLUTION — NEW
    %% =========================================================

    Pattern --> StrategyCandidate["StrategyCandidate@v1"]

    Hypothesis --> ExperimentPlan["ExperimentPlan@v1"]

    StrategyCandidate --> ExperimentPlan

    ExperimentPlan --> OfflineEval["Historical / Offline Evaluation"]

    OfflineEval --> EvaluationReport["EvaluationReport@v1"]

    EvaluationReport --> ControlledTrial["Controlled Production Trial"]

    ControlledTrial -->|same normal production path| Temporal

    ControlledTrial --> Observation

    Observation --> ExperimentOutcome["ExperimentOutcome@v1"]

    ExperimentOutcome --> Promotion["Strategy Promotion Gate"]

    EvaluationReport --> Promotion

    Promotion -->|accepted| PromotionReceipt["StrategyPromotionReceipt@v1"]

    Promotion -->|rejected / inconclusive| Rejected["Archive + Evidence + Reason"]

    PromotionReceipt --> ActiveStrategy["Active Strategy Registry"]

    ActiveStrategy --> PG

    ActiveStrategy -->|versioned strategy context| Loop


    %% =========================================================
    %% DAILY COMPOUNDING KNOWLEDGE
    %% =========================================================

    PG --> DecisionHistory
    PG --> PublicationHistory
    PG --> AudienceHistory
    PG --> ExperimentHistory
    PG --> StrategyHistory

    Storage --> ContentHistory


    %% =========================================================
    %% EXISTING LINEAGE — PRESERVE
    %% =========================================================

    Loop -->|source → immutable brief lineage| PG

    Worker -.->|artifact references| Storage

    Creative -.->|hash-stable content / media| Storage


    %% =========================================================
    %% OPTIONAL FUTURE MODEL ADAPTATION
    %% =========================================================

    PG -.->|curated promoted evidence only| ModelEvolution["Optional Model Evolution
        Fine-Tuning
        Distillation
        Custom Models
        Future Learning Methods"]

    ModelEvolution -.->|validated provider version| Providers


    %% =========================================================
    %% ONE GOVERNANCE / CONTROL SYSTEM, MANY ENFORCEMENT POINTS
    %% =========================================================

    CrossCutting["Salience Cross-Cutting Control Plane
        Identity
        Authority
        Security
        Policy
        Rights
        Budget
        Provenance
        Versioning
        Evaluation
        Observability
        Audit
        Idempotency
        Recovery
        Reconciliation"]

    CrossCutting -.-> API
    CrossCutting -.-> Temporal
    CrossCutting -.-> Loop
    CrossCutting -.-> CapabilityGateway
    CrossCutting -.-> Creative
    CrossCutting -.-> BuildGate
    CrossCutting -.-> PublishGate
    CrossCutting -.-> Observation
    CrossCutting -.-> Learning
    CrossCutting -.-> Promotion